#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:8
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11, each release provides two variants: a FIPS-compliant"
" build and a non-FIPS build. This ensures that organizations with strict "
"compliance requirements can adopt the FIPS version while others can "
"continue with the standard release, both staying in sync with "
"Mattermost’s overall product lifecycle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:10
msgid ""
"Mattermost FIPS-compliant Docker images are built using Chainguard’s "
"FIPS-certified base containers. These images help organizations meet "
"stringent security requirements by ensuring compliance with the Federal "
"Information Processing Standards (FIPS)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:12
msgid ""
"On top of this foundation, Mattermost product code itself is aligned with"
" FIPS requirements, using only FIPS-approved cryptographic algorithms. "
"This ensures that both the underlying container base and the application "
"layer meet compliance expectations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:14
msgid ""
"In addition, the Chainguard base images are STIG-hardened and rigorously "
"scanned against the DISA General Purpose Operating System SRG, providing "
"a robust and secure operational posture."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:17
msgid "Mattermost FIPS Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:19
msgid ""
"Mattermost’s FIPS-compliant images are built using two Chainguard base "
"images:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:21
msgid ""
"`Build-Time Image <https://images.chainguard.dev/directory/image/go-msft-"
"fips/overview>`_: Ensures compiled Mattermost binaries invoke OpenSSL "
"through CGO for FIPS-compliance during compilation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Runtime Image <https://images.chainguard.dev/directory/image/glibc-"
"openssl-fips/overview>`_: Enforces FIPS compliance in the runtime "
"environment using strict OpenSSL configurations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:24
msgid ""
"All application-level code uses only FIPS-approved algorithms, ensuring "
"that cryptographic requirements are consistently enforced across every "
"layer of the system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:28
msgid ""
"The Mattermost FIPS image includes only prepackaged Boards, Playbooks, "
"and Agents. Additional plugins can be added to the Mattermost FIPS image,"
" but they will run in non-FIPS mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:29
msgid ""
"Existing Docker or Kubernetes-based deployments can change the image from"
" ``mattermost/mattermost-enterprise-edition`` to ``mattermost/mattermost-"
"enterprise-fips-edition``."
msgstr ""

